flowchart TD
    caller[Caller supplies an attempt-scoped response packet] --> pack[Bound and validate metadata and bytes]
    pack --> owner{Run, execution and attempt match?}
    owner -->|No| reject[Reject without publishing evidence]
    owner -->|Yes| transaction[Existing batched terminal transaction]
    snapshot[Frozen case, profile and execution plan] --> guard
    transaction --> guard{Live ownership and frozen provenance match?}
    guard -->|No| reject
    guard -->|Yes| update[Same attempt UPDATE stores metadata and byte payload]
    update --> commit[Commit evidence with completion or retry state]
    commit --> read[Explicit attempt-scoped read]
    read --> integrity{Schema, hashes, ranges and budgets valid?}
    integrity -->|No| unavailable[Report unavailable or invalid evidence]
    integrity -->|Yes| restore[Restore immutable content without live handles]
    commit --> deletion[Owner deletion cascades to response evidence]
